OL,3,GNEWSAShot fired at family home in
OL,4,A'appalling' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family home in Sheffield was shot at
OL,7,Fover the weekend, police have said.
OL,9,FSouth Yorkshire Police were called to
OL,10,Fthe house on Hyde Park Terrace at about
OL,11,F21:00 BST on Saturday and found a
OL,12,Fbullet inside the property.
OL,14,FA young woman was inside but nobody was
OL,15,Finjured, officers said. No arrests had
OL,16,Fyet been made in connection with the
OL,17,Fshooting, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
