OL,3,GNEWSAShot fired at family home in
OL,4,A'appalling' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Scott Harrison said: "A
OL,7,Ffamily home has been shot at on a usual
OL,8,FSaturday, while a young woman was at
OL,9,Fhome enjoying her evening. This is
OL,10,Ffrankly appalling."
